.Dd October 29, 2026
.Dt PKGUTIL 8
.Os Minkar
.Sh NAME
.Nm pkgutil
.Nd query and manage the receipts of installed packages
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Ar options
.Op Ar command ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Each package the installer lays down leaves a receipt in
.Pa /var/db/receipts
on its volume: a property list with the package's identifier, version,
install location, install date and groups, and a bill of materials of the
files it installed.
.Nm
lists and describes these receipts and forgets them.
Commands that take a package identifier take several.
.Ss Commands
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl -pkgs , Fl -packages
List the identifiers of the installed packages.
.It Fl -pkgs Ns = Ns Ar regexp
List those that match the extended regular expression, as a whole.
.It Fl -pkgs-plist
List them as a property list.
.It Fl -files Ar pkg-id
List the files and directories the package installed, relative to its
install location.
.It Fl -pkg-info Ar pkg-id
Show the package's identifier, version, volume, install location, install
time (seconds since the epoch) and groups.
.It Fl -pkg-info-plist Ar pkg-id
The same as a property list.
.It Fl -export-plist Ar pkg-id
The package's information and the paths it installed, as a property list.
.It Fl -file-info Ar path
Show, for each package that installed
.Ar path ,
its identifier, version, install time, and the owner, group and mode it
installed the path with.
.It Fl -file-info-plist Ar path
The same as a property list.
.It Fl -forget Ar pkg-id
Remove the package's receipt; its files stay where they are.
.It Fl -groups , Fl -groups-plist
List the groups the receipts name.
.It Fl -group-pkgs Ar group-id
List the packages in a group.
.It Fl -pkg-groups Ar pkg-id
List the groups a package belongs to.
.El
.Ss Options
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Fl -volume Ar path
Use the receipts of the volume (or home directory) at
.Ar path
instead of
.Pa / .
.It Fl -only-files , Fl -only-dirs
With
.Fl -files ,
list only files (and links), or only directories.
.It Fl -regexp
Take package identifier arguments as extended regular expressions.
.It Fl f , Fl -force , Fl v , Fl -verbose
Accepted for compatibility.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Pa /var/db/receipts/ Ns Ar pkg-id Ns Pa .plist
.It Pa /var/db/receipts/ Ns Ar pkg-id Ns Pa .bom
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr lsbom 8
.Sh BUGS
Expanding, flattening and checking flat
.Pa .pkg
files is not done yet.
